# Shell scripts run on the ubuntu-latest runner. A CRLF line ending there fails
# with `$'\r': command not found`, which would take the daily data refresh down
# on a whitespace character. This is developed on Windows, where core.autocrlf
# would otherwise decide the answer per-machine — pin it instead.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Same reasoning for anything else the runner executes or parses as text.
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
